[611.935, "6Galternates all\u001b[31Gvariants in\u001b[43Gshort fix\u001b[53Gd \u001b[56Gounds and compares their medians\u001b[90Gnd minim\u001b[99G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mPrefetching\u001b[15Gmade\u001b[20Gno\u001b[23Gimprovement,\u001b[36Gso\u001b[39GI'm\u001b[43Greverting\u001b[53Git.\u001b[57GAttention\u001b[67Gnow\u001b[71Gcosts\u001b[77Gabout\u001b[83G45\u001b[86Gcycles\u001b[93Gper\u001b[97G(position,\u001b[108Ghead)\u001b[114Gpair,\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gand\u001b[7GI susp\u001b[14Gct \u001b[18Ghe strictly ordered \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mreduce_add\u001b[49G\u001b[39mon the 64-wide vecto\u001b[70G, so I'm checking how Mojo implem\u001b[104Gn\u001b[106Gs i\u001b[110G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRestoring\u001b[13Gbase\u001b[18Gand\u001b[22Ginspecting\u001b[33Greduce_add\u001b[44Gimplementation\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m  \u23bf  $ cd /Users/agentlab/pvc/mj; cp /tmp/mjprof/base.mojo mj.mojo; grep -n \"def reduce_add\" -A 30 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B/Users/Shared/pvc-kit/mojo/docs/stdlib-source/simd.mojo | grep -v '^\\S*-\\s*\"\"\"' | head -45\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;87;105;247m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
